, "evidence": "<div style=\"display: flex; gap: 22px; height: 100%\">\n<div style=\"flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column\">\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 22px; color: #1E1B18; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 4px\">The Masked Ball</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.16em; color: #5C554D; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 10px\">PROGRAMME</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; gap: 18px; padding: 7px 0; border-bottom: 1px dotted #B9B0A2\"><div style=\"font-family: 'Courier Prime', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; width: 64px; color: #1E1B18\">22:00</div><div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; color: #1E1B18\">Doors &amp; punch</div></div><div style=\"display: flex; gap: 18px; padding: 7px 0; border-bottom: 1px dotted #B9B0A2\"><div style=\"font-family: 'Courier Prime', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; width: 64px; color: #1E1B18\">22:30</div><div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; color: #1E1B18\">Welcome – Theo Marsh</div></div><div style=\"display: flex; gap: 18px; padding: 7px 0; border-bottom: 1px dotted #B9B0A2\"><div style=\"font-family: 'Courier Prime', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; width: 64px; color: #1E1B18\">22:45</div><div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; color: #1E1B18\">Charity auction – Oscar Bell</div></div><div style=\"display: flex; gap: 18px; padding: 7px 0; border-bottom: 1px dotted #B9B0A2\"><div style=\"font-family: 'Courier Prime', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; width: 64px; color: #1E1B18\">23:00</div><div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; color: #1E1B18\">The great unmasking</div></div><div style=\"display: flex; gap: 18px; padding: 7px 0; border-bottom: 1px dotted #B9B0A2\">